.TH geectl-pull-request-cancel-review-request 1  "geectl-pull-request-cancel-review-request 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-cancel\-review\-request \- Cancel pending review requests on a pull request. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`. On OBS the cancel fails closed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request cancel\-review\-request\fR [\fB\-\-reviewer\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-exclude\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cancel pending review requests on a pull request. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`. On OBS the cancel fails closed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer\fR \fI<REVIEWER>\fR
The reviewers to cancel, repeatable; `@team` names a team
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Cancel every pending review request
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\fR \fI<EXCLUDE>\fR
With `\-\-all`, leave these reviewers out; `@team` names a team
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
